; The one variable: what a Button paints for itself, across six same-size buttons. Normal is the
; control. Disabled swaps both the stylebox and the font colour, Themed overrides the box, Flat drops
; it, and Left and Right align text against its 24 px content margin. No other golden draws a
; Button, a themed widget stylebox or a disabled state.

[gd_scene load_steps=2 format=3]

